<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21276" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βύω</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Arist.
			<u>HA</u>
			632a18
		</span></i>: fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βύσω [ῡ</span>] Thalesap.<i><span class="en">
			D.L.
			1.35
		</span></i>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπι-</span>) <i><span class="en">
			Cratin.
			186.4
		</span></i>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προ-</span>) <i><span class="en">
			Ar.
			<u>V.</u>
			250
		</span></i>: aor.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔβῡσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Morb.</u>
					3.14
				</span></i>
			, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπι-</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				379
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, only in compds.:—
				Pass.
			, aor.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐβύσθην </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρ-</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Deor.Conc.</u>
				10
			</span></i>: pf.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βέβυσμαι</span>, the tense chiefly in use
			(v. infr.):— <i>stuff</i>, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b> c. gen. rei, <i>stuff full of</i>, only
			in 
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νήματος βεβυσμένος</span>
			<i>stuffed full of</i> spun-work or spinning, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				4.134
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ στόμα ἐβέβυστο</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρυσοῦ</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.125
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνάγκης βεβυσμένος οἶκος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					9.298
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. dat. rei,
				<i>stop</i> or <i>plug with</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βύσας τὴν ἕδρην σπόγγῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
				</span></i>
			 l. c., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
			</span></i> l.c.:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπογγίῳ βεβυσμένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ach.</u>
					463
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κηρίῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Th.</u>
					506
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥαφάνοις τὴν ἕδραν βεβ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
				3.62
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵππος ἀριστήεσσι βεβ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Tryph.
				308
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφραδίῃ τε βέβυστο
			[πόλις</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				450
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> abs.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βεβυσμένος τὴν ῥῖνα</span>
			<i>having</i> one's nose <i>stopped</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hegesipp.
				1.26
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βεβ. τὰ ὦτα</span>
			<i>deaf</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Cat.</u>
				5
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἷμα βεβ</span>. a <i>close,
				thick-woven</i> robe, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				1.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>stow</i> or <i>tuck away</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι ὑπὸ τῇ πτέρυγι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					11.18
				</span></i>
			. (Root <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βυτ-</span>, cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βύζην </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">&lt;Βυσ-δην</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">,
			βύσ-τρα</span>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζέβυται:
			σέσακται</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
